Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.14,0:01:34.02,Default,,0,0,0,,It's coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.85,0:01:40.31,Default,,0,0,0,,KILL
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.61,0:01:50.07,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}This killing intent...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.95,0:03:27.24,Default,,0,0,0,,KILL
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.25,0:03:28.54,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}This killing intent...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.67,0:03:32.01,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}is not Shizuka's...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.01,0:03:34.89,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}This is...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.31,0:03:43.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh! Nagi.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.52,0:03:51.15,Default,,0,0,0,,The fact that you woke up means
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.27,0:03:52.65,Default,,0,0,0,,you felt that just now?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.32,0:03:54.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.53,0:03:58.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Where are we?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.87,0:04:01.66,Default,,0,0,0,,A safe house in Heishi Ward.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.33,0:04:06.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Ever since the Kurosakas found us,\Nwe've been moving every 12 hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.58,0:04:11.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I see...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.34,0:04:14.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.46,0:04:16.05,Default,,0,0,0,,It's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.84,0:04:19.38,Default,,0,0,0,,More importantly,\Nwas that killing intent just now
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.39,0:04:20.85,Default,,0,0,0,,from an Academy pursuer?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.18,0:04:22.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Could they have found this place?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.35,0:04:27.65,Default,,0,0,0,,No. I'm pretty sure it was a pursuer,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.56,0:04:31.48,Default,,0,0,0,,but I don't think they know\Nwhere we are yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.52,0:04:37.40,Default,,0,0,0,,That killing intent wasn't directed\Nat me personally.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.99,0:04:39.91,Default,,0,0,0,,It's more like...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.70,0:04:44.91,Default,,0,0,0,,It was being\Nindiscriminately cast around...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.25,0:04:54.42,Default,,0,0,0,,You mean... like a warning?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.50,0:04:56.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.84,0:05:00.59,Default,,0,0,0,,It meant, "I'll find you,\Nno matter what, and kill you."
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.64,0:05:08.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Shizuka.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.69,0:05:10.57,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.06,0:05:13.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to say this again.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.07,0:05:18.07,Default,,0,0,0,,You should leave this island\Non your own while you still can.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.57,0:05:22.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Again?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.74,0:05:25.58,Default,,0,0,0,,We already settled this.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.79,0:05:28.21,Default,,0,0,0,,You felt it too, didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.04,0:05:33.34,Default,,0,0,0,,The fact that this pursuer is deliberately\Nletting us know they're here
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.08,0:05:36.54,Default,,0,0,0,,makes them seem\Nlike some childish egotist, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.21,0:05:40.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I sensed a level of resolve\Nand brutality from them
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.80,0:05:42.22,Default,,0,0,0,,that I've never felt before.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.72,0:05:45.35,Default,,0,0,0,,And that killing intent just now
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.31,0:05:48.35,Default,,0,0,0,,felt strangely familiar somehow.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.89,0:05:51.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Who on earth...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.52,0:05:56.77,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't keep running with me for long.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.69,0:06:00.74,Default,,0,0,0,,But you may still get away\Nif you're on your own.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.24,0:06:06.41,Default,,0,0,0,,You've always been like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.87,0:06:07.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.33,0:06:10.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Taking everything on yourself...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.54,0:06:15.42,Default,,0,0,0,,And it's always,\N"It's dangerous, so stay back."
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.63,0:06:19.38,Default,,0,0,0,,It's getting seriously annoying.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.67,0:06:21.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? Annoying...?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.88,0:06:27.05,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}THREE YEARS AGO
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.51,0:06:31.05,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}POOR CONTACT, PRESS HARD
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.49,0:06:48.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I wasn't talented...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.91,0:06:52.50,Default,,0,0,0,,If you hadn't saved me back then,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.16,0:06:55.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Sensei would have made me "graduate"...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.21,0:07:00.63,Default,,0,0,0,,And the reason you're like this now
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.09,0:07:04.09,Default,,0,0,0,,is because you took the hit for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.26,0:07:08.80,Default,,0,0,0,,It's my turn to save you!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.26,0:07:13.10,Default,,0,0,0,,So for once, just sit back and rely on me!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.06,0:07:23.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Besides, Sensei's killing intent\Nmight even be able to heal your body.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.86,0:07:27.78,Default,,0,0,0,,If they're coming to us on their own,\Nthat's actually perfect for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.05,0:07:45.97,Default,,0,0,0,,You do realize what you're saying, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.05,0:07:49.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if we manage to draw out\NSensei's killing intent,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.22,0:07:53.14,Default,,0,0,0,,we'll be killed if we can't beat them.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.10,0:07:55.56,Default,,0,0,0,,We're talking about Sensei...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.48,0:08:03.27,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}They've been here for five years.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.94,0:08:08.57,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The brother, Nagi, is already one\Nof the best students we've ever had,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.16,0:08:11.33,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}but his little sister is hopeless.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.12,0:08:14.96,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}She's just a useless piece of junk.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.91,0:08:16.83,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Hmph.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.62,0:08:19.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Then...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.47,0:08:32.85,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I don't need this anymore.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.32,0:08:54.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I... I have a plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.58,0:08:57.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh? Then let's hear it...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.83,0:09:01.96,Default,,0,0,0,,- Get down.\N- What?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.25,0:09:03.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Get down!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.13,0:09:48.22,Default,,0,0,0,,We got a tip about a young woman\Nwith a guy in a wheelchair.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.01,0:09:50.68,Default,,0,0,0,,And we hit the jackpot!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.30,0:09:56.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, don't you think we should've reported\Nthis to Kurosaka first?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.39,0:10:01.23,Default,,0,0,0,,This is a mission straight from Sensei.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.52,0:10:02.73,Default,,0,0,0,,It's our chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.31,0:10:08.15,Default,,0,0,0,,If we distinguish ourselves here,\Nwe could even jump straight up to Class A.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.65,0:10:14.57,Default,,0,0,0,,We Class C students don't even have\Nthe freedom to choose our own hairstyles.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.20,0:10:17.79,Default,,0,0,0,,If we want to live like human beings\Nat the Academy,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.04,0:10:20.67,Default,,0,0,0,,we have no choice but to move up\Nto a higher class.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.66,0:10:21.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.91,0:10:23.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I know, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.87,0:10:26.33,Default,,0,0,0,,We're talking about Nagi Tahira here,\Nyou know...?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.59,0:10:29.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't be stupid.\NEven if he's the "strongest in history,"
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.05,0:10:32.51,Default,,0,0,0,,he's practically unconscious right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.76,0:10:35.68,Default,,0,0,0,,He must be full of holes by now.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.76,0:10:39.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Now then, his little body...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.14,0:10:41.81,Default,,0,0,0,,where could it be?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.60,0:11:21.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Nagi, we have to kill them\Nbefore they can contact the Kurosakas!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.22,0:11:23.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I know,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.73,0:11:25.57,Default,,0,0,0,,but my wheelchair's busted.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.06,0:11:27.48,Default,,0,0,0,,How are we gonna chase them?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.15,0:11:29.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.90,0:11:33.90,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Shit! Shit!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.49,0:11:35.37,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'm scared.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.95,0:11:40.37,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I underestimated Class A.\NWhat the hell is that monster?!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.91,0:11:42.16,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I don't wanna die!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.16,0:11:43.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Gah!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.12,0:11:44.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?! "Gah"?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.96,0:11:49.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Tank Chair Emergency.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.59,0:11:55.63,Default,,0,0,0,,"The Caster."
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.05,0:12:00.47,Default,,0,0,0,,You're... heavy...!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.93,0:12:04.06,Default,,0,0,0,,You wanted to help me, right?\NCome on, push, push!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.64,0:12:09.52,Default,,0,0,0,,You big... jerk...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.22,0:12:38.22,Default,,0,0,0,,You sleepy?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.51,0:12:40.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Pretty much...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.39,0:12:46.14,Default,,0,0,0,,If they've mobilized even Class C,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.98,0:12:48.82,Default,,0,0,0,,then there's a good chance
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.64,0:12:52.31,Default,,0,0,0,,every route off Guicheng Island\Nis under surveillance.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.52,0:12:56.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like we're trapped on the island...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.25,0:13:10.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, I give up.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.83,0:13:14.75,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll fight the Academy. No...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.30,0:13:17.72,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll fight Sensei.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.17,0:13:20.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Shizuka,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.55,0:13:22.59,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm counting on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.11,0:13:37.57,Default,,0,0,0,,That said,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.49,0:13:40.78,Default,,0,0,0,,we don't stand a chance\Nif we take them head-on.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.53,0:13:43.03,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll definitely be killed.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.70,0:13:44.66,Default,,0,0,0,,What are we gonna do?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.83,0:13:49.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's complete the "No Mark."
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.54,0:13:53.21,Default,,0,0,0,,If there's any hope of beating Sensei,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.38,0:13:55.55,Default,,0,0,0,,that's our only chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.13,0:14:00.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I see. So that means...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.13,0:14:02.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.55,0:14:06.59,Default,,0,0,0,,We need to go see...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.47,0:14:10.72,Default,,0,0,0,,the designer of the Tank Chair, Dr. Radio.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.59,0:14:45.63,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Go home.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.80,0:14:49.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, don't be like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.31,0:14:51.77,Default,,0,0,0,,KIGAI WARD, GUICHENG ISLAND
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.77,0:14:55.61,Default,,0,0,0,,We've come all this way out here.\NLet us in.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.60,0:14:57.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Turn off the traps and everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.65,0:15:03.40,Default,,0,0,0,,This is important.\NWe want to talk to you in person.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.95,0:15:05.16,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}No, thank you.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.49,0:15:08.49,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I won't help with going\Nto war with the Academy.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.70,0:15:10.24,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}It's suicidal!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.99,0:15:14.66,Default,,0,0,0,,As sharp as ever, Dr. Radio.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.67,0:15:21.63,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I have eyes all over Guicheng.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.63,0:15:25.42,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I can guess why you're here.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.51,0:15:30.77,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Don't do anything stupid.\NHole up somewhere quick.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.10,0:15:38.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I figured...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.53,0:15:48.62,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}This is for the best.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.37,0:15:54.63,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Their chances of surviving\Nare better this way.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.88,0:16:06.71,Default,,0,0,0,,KILL
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.93,0:16:12.81,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Hm?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.14,0:16:16.85,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Huh?!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.28,0:16:27.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Tank Chair Mark VI.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.82,0:16:29.86,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}"Mach Speed."
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.86,0:16:31.32,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}TANK CHAIR MARK VI: "MACH SPEED"
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.57,0:16:34.87,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Mark VI?! No way...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.20,0:16:38.62,Default,,0,0,0,,We figured you'd say no,\Nso we came prepared.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.62,0:16:40.25,Default,,0,0,0,,She woke me up...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.67,0:16:42.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Coming through!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.71,0:16:43.71,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Hey! Stop it!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.75,0:16:46.13,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Idiots!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.81,0:17:00.98,Default,,0,0,0,,The old radio tower's\Nthree kilometers ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.52,0:17:02.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Roger.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.77,0:17:43.48,Default,,0,0,0,,INTRUDERS\NINTERCEPT AND ELIMINATE
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.53,0:17:51.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Here they come!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.68,0:18:13.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.30,0:18:16.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.03,0:18:39.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Shizuka! Which way?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.50,0:18:41.38,Default,,0,0,0,,ROUTE NOT ADVISABLE
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.75,0:18:43.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Go in there!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.96,0:18:45.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.19,0:19:09.94,Default,,0,0,0,,GO THROUGH THE TUNNEL TO REACH\NDR. RADIO'S PLACE.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.32,0:19:13.49,Default,,0,0,0,,We just have to keep going straight\Nand we'll reach the place...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.28,0:19:15.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.38,0:19:36.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Ugh, I'm really terrible at shooting!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.51,0:19:38.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, what's with these guys?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.47,0:19:40.06,Default,,0,0,0,,You sure we're on the right route?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.60,0:19:43.10,Default,,0,0,0,,They weren't here before.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.77,0:19:47.07,Default,,0,0,0,,They're probably some\Nnew "security system" from Dr. Radio.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.60,0:19:50.35,Default,,0,0,0,,As twisted as ever!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.11,0:19:58.07,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Hmph. I'm just recycling the trash\Nthat trespasses in my yard.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.62,0:20:01.54,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I never let any corpse go to waste.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.41,0:20:07.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.46,0:20:10.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Nagi, faster!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.42,0:20:11.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait! There are tons ahead!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.67,0:20:14.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Gross!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.63,0:20:18.09,Default,,0,0,0,,- Hold on tight.\N- Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.28,0:20:43.03,Default,,0,0,0,,- M... My neck.\N- Just from that?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.16,0:20:48.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Unlike you, I'm just a normal human!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.50,0:20:57.42,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}GUICHENG THIRD RADIO CENTER
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.01,0:21:02.30,Default,,0,0,0,,A... Anyway,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.72,0:21:04.14,Default,,0,0,0,,we made it somehow!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.10,0:21:12.35,Default,,0,0,0,,They won't give up.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.57,0:21:24.20,Default,,0,0,0,,You really don't want to see us\Nthat badly, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.83,0:21:25.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Nagi!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.49,0:21:27.49,Default,,0,0,0,,I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.15,0:21:58.61,Default,,0,0,0,,W... We're here.
